  Opened over the Settings window by the open button of File Preferences (dyl:Win.Open of
  Dyl-Settings.xaml), on its values: OK keeps them, saved with the other settings by Save.
  The paths of the DynALisp profile (Remote\Dyl-FilePrefs.lsp, Res\FilePrefs.csv): the lists
  in the *fp:prefs* order (*dyl:setprefs*: pcl pun pla), then whether the DynALisp custom
  dictionary of the language is used (pcd, DynalispPrefCustomDict, when the language has
  one), and the current profile (pfs).
